@startuml "Configuration des billets - Organisateur"

title Configuration des types de billets

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Configuration des billets ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Configurer types de billets
Frontend -> API: POST /api/events/{eventId}/tickets
note right: Body: {ticketTypes: [{name, price, quantity, description}]}
API -> Auth: Vérifier propriété événement
Auth -> DB: SELECT event WHERE id=? AND organizerId=?
DB --> Auth: event owned by organizer

API -> TicketSvc: createTicketTypes(eventId, ticketTypes)

loop Pour chaque type de billet
    TicketSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO ticket_types (eventId, name, price, quantity, available)
    DB --> TicketSvc: ticketTypeId
    
    TicketSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO tickets (eventId, ticketTypeId, status='available')
    note right: Créer {quantity} billets individuels
    DB --> TicketSvc: tickets created
end

TicketSvc --> API: ticket types created
API --> Frontend: ticket configuration saved
Frontend --> Organizer: "Types de billets configurés"

@enduml